 recipes","ref":"site/somethingsweetsomethingsavoury-com","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"somethingsweetsomethingsavoury.com","note":"Scottish home baking and cooking section of a UK food blog.","url":"https://somethingsweetsomethingsavoury.com/category/scottish-recipes/","suggested":true}]},{"h":"More from Scottish cuisine","links":[["Cock-a-leekie","dish/cock-a-leekie"],["Finnan haddie","dish/finnan-haddie"],["Haggis","dish/haggis"],["Haggis pakora","dish/haggis-pakora"],["Hobnob biscuit","dish/hobnob-biscuit"],["Lorne sausage","dish/lorne-sausage"],["Mince and tatties","dish/mince-and-tatties"],["Rumbledethumps","dish/rumbledethumps"],["Scotch broth","dish/scotch-broth"],["Skirlie","dish/skirlie"],["Stornoway black pudding","dish/stornoway-black-pudding"]]}]},"dish/ellen-s-stardust-diner":{"t":"dish","r":"dish/ellen-s-stardust-diner","n":"Ellen's Stardust Diner","c":"#ede6da","crumb":[["Dishes","dishes"]],"sub":"Dish from American cuisine","dot":"#94bd5c","intro":[["Ellen's Stardust Diner is a retro 1950s theme restaurant located at 1650 Broadway on the southeast corner of 51st Street in Theater District, Manhattan, New York City. The diner is regarded as one of the best theme restaurants in New York owing to its singing waitstaff. The diner also contains retro-themed memorabilia such as photos of many past Miss Subways on the walls, an indoor train, a 1956 Predicta television, and a “drive-in theater” screen that showcases performances of the 1950s. It is popular among children and adults."]],"src":"wikipedia","actions":[{"kind":"globe","hash":"dish-ellen-s-stardust-diner"},{"kind":"wiki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ellen's_Stardust_Diner"}],"sections":[{"h":"Where it's from","links":[["American cuisine","cuisine/american-cuisine"]]},{"h":"More from American cuisine","links":[["5-8 Club","dish/5-8-club"],["Altabira City Tavern","dish/altabira-city-tavern"],["Angel food cake","dish/angel-food-cake"],["Applebee's","dish/applebee-s"],["Arby's","dis